{"id":"chatcmpl-83d9e6bf-81ce-4c26-b3e6-cac9351847fc","object":"chat.completion","created":1795250466,"model":"deepseek-v4.1-flash","choices":[{"index":0,"message":{"role":"assistant","reasoning_content":"","content":"{\n  \"highlights\": \"Successful visual question answering on medical images requires cross-validating findings from multiple specialized tools to resolve laterality and avoid common confusions. The strategy combines expert interpretation, grounded localization, and phrase grounding to confirm the correct option. This multi-source verification ensures high confidence in the final answer.\",\n  \"patterns\": [\n    \"When a question asks to choose between two lateralized findings, use multiple tools to independently confirm the side (e.g., expert interpretation, grounded report, phrase grounding).\",\n    \"For tasks involving anatomical localization, compare relative positions (e.g., diaphragm heights) using expert descriptions and visual grounding to avoid left-right confusion.\",\n    \"When available, leverage phrase grounding to verify that a specific finding (e.g., 'elevated right hemidiaphragm') is localized to the correct side in the image.\",\n    \"Cross-check the final answer against historical feedback or known benchmarks to ensure consistency with established ground truth.\"\n  ],\n  \"playbooks\": {\n    \"Medical Imaging Analysis\": \"Use a combination of expert interpretation, grounded localization, and phrase grounding to confirm findings and laterality. Always compare relative anatomical positions when evaluating elevation or asymmetry.\",\n    \"Visual Question Answering with Multiple Tools\": \"Deploy specialized tools for different aspects: one for expert opinion, one for grounded localization, and one for phrase grounding. Synthesize their outputs to resolve ambiguities.\",\n    \"Laterality-Sensitive Tasks\": \"When left vs. right is critical, employ at least two independent methods to confirm the side. Pay attention to image orientation (e.g., patient's right appears on image left).\"\n  },\n  \"checklists\": [\n    \"Confirm that the finding is lateralized correctly by cross-referencing expert description and phrase grounding results.\",\n    \"Verify that the chosen option matches the majority of tool outputs and any available benchmark feedback.\"\n  ]\n}"},"finish_reason":"stop","logprobs":null}],"usage":{"prompt_tokens":488,"total_tokens":872,"completion_tokens":384,"prompt_tokens_details":{"cached_tokens":0,"image_tokens":0,"text_tokens":488},"completion_tokens_details":{"text_tokens":384}}}